{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12201110","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12201110","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1220111001:0":{"text":"ごめんなさい、セシリアさん。ジョナサンさんの家は……その……グチャグチャで、鍵を見つけることも、彼に会うこともできませんでした。","source_cn":"抱歉，塞西莉亚，乔纳森家附近……呃，有点乱，我们没找到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91F2F01B49B69F51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1220111002:0":{"text":"そうですか。あの人、部屋を片付けるのが嫌いだったから……","source_cn":"是吗，那家伙就是不喜欢收拾房间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF1DD5B67B7328C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220111003:0":{"text":"前に部屋を片付けてあげたら、「片付けられると、必要な物が見つからなくなるんだよ」と文句を言われたことがあります。","source_cn":"之前我给他整理，他还会抱怨“让你一收拾就找不到了”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B97612A6D93BD9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220111004:0":{"text":"鍵を見つけることはできませんでしたが、日記がありました！","source_cn":"虽然没有找到钥匙，不过我们找到了一本日记！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9087494BA1C83CBF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220111005:0":{"text":"日記？ジョナサンの日記ですか？日記には何と？","source_cn":"日记？是乔纳森的日记吗？他写了什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x898E78E23377D942","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","docum